  "details": "AnimationIntMod - Modulo operations(returning remainder of division) for AnimationInt variable. It would allow us to create proper loops without having to switch around objects. \nFor example:\nvariable=1 value=3\nAnimationIntMod 1%3=1\nAnimationIntAdd 1+1=2\n2%3=2; 2+1=2\n3%3=0; 0+1=1\nand repeat\n\nAnimationIntGet/Copy - something that would allow us to read/store current variable or pass it as value to another trigger.\n\nAlso similar actions and the ones we already have for Int could be applied to float:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/float-math-and-simple-variables",
